  <section id="about" data-rise>
    <h2><span class="no">01</span>About<span class="rule"></span></h2>
    <p>
      I am finishing my B.Eng. in New Energy Science and Engineering (wind-energy track) at
      North China Electric Power University (expected June 2027), with a GPA of 82.9% and
      strong results in my wind-engineering specialization — Turbine Aerodynamics and
      Wind Resource Measurement &amp; Assessment (95/100), Numerical Simulation (90).
    </p>
    <p>
      My hands-on background combines <b>CFD simulation</b> of wind-relevant external flows
      (ANSYS Fluent / OpenFOAM) with <b>hardware and embedded systems</b>: I won
      the <b>National First Prize</b> in the China Undergraduate Electronic Design Contest
      (power-monitoring circuit design and system integration), and I maintain a small
      portfolio of open hardware / edge-computing projects. I am looking for a fully funded
      PhD position (Fall 2027) in renewable-energy integration, power-system simulation,
      and grid interfacing.
    </p>
  </section>

